{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"5c30d82588853dc6d0ccea637a71465d6b1d72509f2db188064e7c4f693f513b","ja":"突然の指令","zh":"突然的指令","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"8782eca1dfbbd18020bfa13458165ebbeafaf46509aae55afa8aaa00319b1cff","ja":"今日のお仕事はバラエティ番組の収録。\nみんなは楽屋で出番を待っていて……","zh":"今天的工作是录制综艺节目。\n大家在休息室里等待出场……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"30d7a234be2d2921229422bfaec8f9ef3fce8b66f5a86cbb161e776e5fed377c","ja":"おや？　このみはどこに行ったのでしょう？\nもうすぐ本番のはずですが。","zh":"哎呀？木美去哪里了呢？\n马上就要正式开演了才对。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d22e4393ec2bdfbe758152ec49fad005dbfb0a3d75b9cb39d7adcb53ae478160","ja":"さっき、スタッフさんに呼ばれて出て行ったよ。","zh":"刚才被工作人员叫出去了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b0253ab93a0c390ad6f7346c07a8e8b950c04e328a86762f71fbaa1c44a7df8a","ja":"それと、スタッフさんが、\n台本に変更があったから見ておいてほしいって。","zh":"还有，工作人员说\n剧本有改动，让你先过目一下。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d5a078473265b905edc0143595a89782d334a8a03f1f958617e5177844d291d5","ja":"企画の内容が変わったのでしょうか？\n……えっ、こ、これは……！？","zh":"企划的内容有变动吗？\n……诶，这、这是……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7578176f45503a25a0e5f2ee64a82696207a8c84e0a50204bee23252f561ad6f","ja":"えっ！　『心霊ドッキリ』！？","zh":"咦！　《灵异恶作剧》！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c3bffb2a6d84e54d737a32d26630c821f7e8620f033ad99dda7aaaffc02f571c","ja":"桃子ちゃんが幽霊にとりつかれたフリをして、\nこのみさんに除霊させるの！？","zh":"让桃子假装被幽灵附身，\n然后再让木实姐来除灵吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"189a67936ba097d35d6be7f071bdc6f398facad8ca964f2068ccdcebbeccaed3","ja":"なんと……私たちが馬場さんをドッキリにかけるの\nですね。……責任重大だぞ。","zh":"竟然……要由我们来整蛊马场小姐\n啊。……真是责任重大呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"ba0214b7d4c16e683faf65cf0060a8a41e5ae6d48a975fa3b5e8ce7853fe87a8","ja":"そ、そうだよね！　わたしたちが失敗しちゃったら、\n番組がおもしろくなくなっちゃうから……。","zh":"也是、是这样呢！要是我们搞砸了，\n节目就会变得无趣了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2897f44c3ce5a08b205695bbb679f0e828cb8b9dc633167b27257be09f600cb8","ja":"お待たせー……って、どうしたの？\nなんだかみんな慌ててるみたいだけど……？","zh":"久等啦——……等等，怎么了？\n大家好像都有些慌慌张张的……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"b8f953fd84fd420a0826348104f76746f0107b041f524e71535d9a6928430cf2","ja":"そ、それは……実は周防さんが最近、\nおかしな現象に遭うそうなのです。","zh":"这、这个嘛……其实周防同学最近，\n好像遇到了奇怪的现象。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b715b7ef89d3c59a60c3c6c20f1d1586b59adc9d1c9840b6b6a3888e341c9195","ja":"……そ、そうみたい。かなしばり……とか？　それで\nこのみさんが急に入って来たからびっくりして……。","zh":"……好、好像是的。鬼压床……什么的？然后\n木实姐突然进来了，吓了我一跳……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e6dae6a90bee229d52c1c088c1bb3dde869eda95d163119a511b9de4b929b43d","ja":"えっ……金縛りって……\nそ、そんなことあるわけないじゃない！","zh":"诶……鬼压床什么的……\n怎、怎么可能会有那种事嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"54a8210aba8ce74b3e494f9ea4489274e18cfbf6c8d5dff3fca763af2330d538","ja":"ですが、他にも霊の仕業としか思えないことがあるとか\n……それで、映画のロケ地からついてきたのかも、と。","zh":"但是，据说还有其他只能认为是幽灵所为的事情\n……所以怀疑是不是从电影的外景地跟过来了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"42c77d753b9ce1499a0aed1a5ca74ae6e2a72659f81ba0218828dd7b13866a46","ja":"え、えっと～……あっ！　打ち合わせの部屋で忘れ物\nしちゃってたわ！　私、取りに行ってくるわね！","zh":"呃、那个～……啊！我把东西落在开会的房间\n里了！我这就去拿回来哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1e7db34fe51ceb25ce57bdcd924fc37978750503f61c92ed03fdc2cae0d3157f","ja":"ビックリした～。このみさん、いきなり戻って\nくるから……。でも幽霊のこと、気にしてたよね？","zh":"吓我一跳～。因为木实小姐突然就折返\n回来了……。不过她果然还是挺在意幽灵的事吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"ca154ab11ae98a3c9546816eef833f7eedb41dfc58616a0eb38a8a954b13aae9","ja":"はい……どっきりにかける下地はできたかと。\nとっさに対応できた、瑞希と育のおかげです。","zh":"是的……整人的铺垫应该已经做好了。\n多亏了瑞希和育能够当场迅速应对。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1314.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8a1c77a12ec8df41bbfe0cb8b083f51fe8bc365594987f5bfb3ddd25daac90ae","ja":"うん。とにかく、この後も頑張って、みんなで\n「ドッキリ大成功！」って、言えるようにしなきゃ！","zh":"嗯。总之之后也得加把劲，\n争取能和大家一起喊出“整蛊大成功！”才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
